OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry start to the day
OL,6,Fthis morning with some brightness.
OL,7,FThen clouding over with scattered
OL,8,Fshowers breaking out through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Feeling rather cool.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers will mostly die
OL,12,Fout this evening. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be mainly dry but still the
OL,14,Fodd shower across western Tayside.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA dry morning with sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Becoming cloudier in the
OL,18,Fafternoon with a few light showers
OL,19,Facross the west and north. Staying dry
OL,20,Felsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
