OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,6,Fbright on Sunday. Becoming unsettled
OL,7,Fon Monday and Tuesday, perhaps heavy
OL,8,Fat times.
